{"id":"445c5abc119b36f4","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-epsilon-closure-notation.md","title":"epsilon closure notation","display":"df-epsilon-closure-notation — epsilon closure notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-epsilon-closure-notation","display":"df-epsilon-closure-notation — epsilon closure notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-epsilon-closure-notation","73-definition-1.6"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_numbering":"local-catalog; not book numbering","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.4, pp. 24–28; local typed epsilon labels and closure functions","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-epsilon-closure-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-closure-notation — epsilon closure notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a33552223dc0fdf0\" href=\"?note=a33552223dc0fdf0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-epsilon-closure-notation</span><span>73-definition-1.6</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.4, pp. 24–28; local typed epsilon labels and closure functions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a33552223dc0fdf0\" href=\"?note=a33552223dc0fdf0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q\">\\(q\\in Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Q\">\\(S\\subseteq Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ECLOSE}\">\\(\\mathrm{ECLOSE}\\)</span> 的参数为单个状态，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}\\)</span> 的参数为状态集；两个函数的参数类型不混用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ECLOSE}(q)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq Q:q\\in U\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ECLOSE}(q)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq Q:q\\in U\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in S}\\mathrm{ECLOSE}(q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in S}\\mathrm{ECLOSE}(q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭包候选族含有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，故交集确有定义。保持原交集闭包及单状态/状态集两个调用名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a33552223dc0fdf0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a33552223dc0fdf0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}$，见 [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-notation]]；$q\\in Q$、$S\\subseteq Q$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\varepsilon\\mathrm{}\\mathrm{NFA}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ECLOSE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ECLOSE}(q)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq Q:q\\in U\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in S}\\mathrm{ECLOSE}(q)","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":1882,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ffa4d7b72a6a19e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ECLOSE},\\mathrm{ECLOSE_1}$ 使用 [[73-df-epsilon-closure-notation]] 的同一机器环境。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-closure-notation|epsilon closure notation]]"}],"outgoing":["a33552223dc0fdf0","0a6da8c909717780"]}